{"id":"n76007-1-7","stage":5,"title":"조합 · 组合","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n76007-1-7-1","ko":"이 초록 포장지에 노란 리본을 매면 어떨까?","zh":"如果在绿色包装纸上系条黄色丝带怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"초록","meaning":"草绿，草绿色","explanation":"초록：草绿，草绿色。","readings":[{"term":"초록","audio":"/audio/04631d74f90fa5919a63.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80522","senseId":"1","lemma":"초록","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"초록","audio":"/audio/04631d74f90fa5919a63.mp3"}},{"text":"포장지에","meaning":"包装纸","explanation":"포장지：包装纸；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"포장지","audio":"/audio/bb5bd83c764703192ba7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84694","senseId":"1","lemma":"포장지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"포장지에","audio":"/audio/195c69c57ff3f5bf55e7.mp3"}},{"text":"노란","meaning":"黄色的","explanation":"노랗다：黄色的；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"노랗다","audio":"/audio/c4c95c7fd5963a0fffee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40101","senseId":"1","lemma":"노랗다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노란","audio":"/audio/590486163ad4893a836c.mp3"}},{"text":"리본을","meaning":"缎带，飘带","explanation":"리본：缎带，飘带；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"리본","audio":"/audio/cc3ee69ddafcd1e4a76f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50111","senseId":"1","lemma":"리본","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"리본을","audio":"/audio/9dfe3803d8389e56a6cf.mp3"}},{"text":"매면","meaning":"打，系","explanation":"매다：打，系；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"매다","audio":"/audio/0341d7416782d5c7f5f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26487","senseId":"2",